      { t = "note", text = "Fin de Felwood. Garde les vases (Undercity). Suite : Burning Steppes & Blasted Lands. Remonte à Bloodvenom Post, vole vers Orgrimmar, zeppelin vers Undercity.", en = "End of Felwood. Keep the oozes (Undercity). Next: Burning Steppes & Blasted Lands. Ride back to Bloodvenom Post, fly to Orgrimmar, zeppelin to Undercity." },
